('Orders publishes OrderPlaced to the\nin-process event bus. Billing\nsubscribes. No direct imports from\norders to billing.', 'Orders commits an outbox event with\nits state. A relay sends to a durable\nqueue; a separate Billing worker\nsubscribes. No direct Orders call\nto Billing is needed.'),
